      "value": "I actually quit like having it locked to the head rotation since it allows me see if i'm standing straight. I always had trouble getting everything lined up right and not end up with my feet and/or my hip slightly turned  because I was looking at the mirror and not straight ahead while calibrating. Maybe a toggle for this would be great",
